WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:12.460
In tutorial 2.2, you'll prove your website
is yours with a DNS record or a meta tag.

00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:17.816
First, open Website settings,
then Verification & Google.

00:00:17.866 --> 00:00:21.110
Pick Add a DNS record if
you look after your domain.

00:00:22.084 --> 00:00:27.259
A DNS record is a short line of text
you add where your domain is managed.

00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:30.261
Click Copy to take the
value made for your website.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.856
Not sure where it goes? Click
Show me how, step by step.

00:00:34.906 --> 00:00:37.599
The guide opens with your
own domain filled in.

00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:42.285
Open a step, then pick your
provider, like GoDaddy,

00:00:42.285 --> 00:00:44.715
and the guide tells you
exactly where to click.

00:00:46.685 --> 00:00:49.735
Once it's saved, come
back and click Check now.

00:00:49.785 --> 00:00:53.485
A new DNS record can take
an hour or two to show up.

00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:56.710
If it's not there yet,
you'll see Not verified yet.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.366
Wait a little and press Check now
again, or click Walk me through it.

00:01:01.336 --> 00:01:06.681
Prefer to edit your homepage instead?
Choose Add a meta tag, and click Copy tag.

00:01:06.731 --> 00:01:10.591
Paste it into the top part of your
homepage's code, the head section.

00:01:10.641 --> 00:01:12.991
Your site builder
usually has a box for it,

00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:17.816
and Show me how has the steps for
WordPress, Shopify, Wix and more.

00:01:17.866 --> 00:01:20.548
A meta tag shows once
your page is published.

00:01:21.517 --> 00:01:25.417
When Alaventra finds it, the
page says ownership is verified,

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:29.122
and the website's dashboards,
tracking and site checks open.

00:01:30.152 --> 00:01:35.187
So, choose a DNS record or a meta tag,
copy the value, add it with the guide,

00:01:35.237 --> 00:01:36.480
and click Check now.

00:01:37.454 --> 00:01:40.004
Your website is verified. Next,

00:01:40.054 --> 00:01:44.159
connect Search Console and
Google Analytics in tutorial 2.3.
